    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "### Problem\n\nCurrently the provided `markdown` and `markdown_inline` parsers come with the default settings which don't include the tags and WikiLink extensions. Providing the parser with these by default means that Neovim can be more easily extended for more note-taking-oriented applications using treesitter.\n\nExtension options are listed in [this table](https://github.com/tree-sitter-grammars/tree-sitter-markdown#extensions) of the tree-sitter-markdown repo.\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nMarkdown parsers are able to parse tags and WikiLinks",
    "closed_at": "2026-10-07T11:19:21Z",
