    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Sorry, we are not going to go down that road (optional parser features) since that would mean that it would be even harder to reason about supported features on individual installs. (These features are not installable.)\n\nIf you need custom features, you'll have to install the parser (e.g., via nvim-treesitter or any of the other installers) yourself.",
