            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "No problem, thanks for the quick reply. So the only way would be for the parser to support these by default? Also I'm not talking about having these optional but rather having Neovim use them as the default.\n\nAlso wanted to link to this issue in the treesitter repo here https://github.com/nvim-treesitter/nvim-treesitter/issues/3076 since it discusses something similar but is still open.",
