        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Yes, if these extensions were enabled by default, these would of course be available (but note that they are optional for a reason).\n\nI know what you mean, but they're still optional from the point of view of the parser -- which is an external lib taken from runtimepath, so there is zero control over user or system installed versions with different options. The only reasonable policy here is to take the stock parser and let advanced users who know what they're doing override this with a custom install.",
